 "body_html": "<h2>怎麼想</h2><p>一個圖形放大或縮小後得到的圖形和原圖形<b>相似</b>，記成「～」，例如 ABCD ～ PQRS（頂點按對應順序寫）。</p><p>多邊形相似：<b>對應角相等，而且對應邊成比例</b>。對應邊的比叫<b>相似比</b>。</p><p>相似形的周長比 ＝ 相似比；放大縮小時角度不變。<div class='qfig'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 112 92' width='112' height='92' role='img' aria-label='長方形 ABCD'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><line x1='26.0' y1='66.0' x2='86.0' y2='66.0' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='86.0' y1='66.0' x2='86.0' y2='26.0' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='86.0' y1='26.0' x2='26.0' y2='26.0' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='26.0' y1='26.0' x2='26.0' y2='66.0' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='26.0' cy='66.0' r='2.5' fill='#2b2b2b'/><text x='11.9' y='79.3' font-size='14' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>A</text><circle cx='86.0' cy='66.0' r='2.5' fill='#2b2b2b'/><text x='100.1' y='79.3' font-size='14' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>B</text><circle cx='86.0' cy='26.0' r='2.5' fill='#2b2b2b'/><text x='100.1' y='22.7' font-size='14' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>C</text><circle cx='26.0' cy='26.0' r='2.5' fill='#2b2b2b'/><text x='11.9' y='22.7' font-size='14' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>D</text><text x='56.0' y='87.0' font-size='13' font-weight='700' fill='#1f5fa8' text-anchor='middle'>3</text><text x='102.0' y='51.0' font-size='13' font-weight='700' fill='#1f5fa8' text-anchor='middle'>2</text></g></svg></div><div class='qfig'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 172 132' width='172' height='132' role='img' aria-label='長方形 PQRS'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><line x1='26.0' y1='106.0' x2='146.0' y2='106.0' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='146.0' y1='106.0' x2='146.0' y2='26.0' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='146.0' y1='26.0' x2='26.0' y2='26.0' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='26.0' y1='26.0' x2='26.0' y2='106.0' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><circle cx='26.0' cy='106.0' r='2.5' fill='#2b2b2b'/><text x='11.9' y='119.3' font-size='14' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>P</text><circle cx='146.0' cy='106.0' r='2.5' fill='#2b2b2b'/><text x='160.1' y='119.3' font-size='14' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>Q</text><circle cx='146.0' cy='26.0' r='2.5' fill='#2b2b2b'/><text x='160.1' y='22.7' font-size='14' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>R</text><circle cx='26.0' cy='26.0' r='2.5' fill='#2b2b2b'/><text x='11.9' y='22.7' font-size='14' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>S</text><text x='86.0' y='127.0' font-size='13' font-weight='700' fill='#1f5fa8' text-anchor='middle'>6</text><text x='162.0' y='71.0' font-size='13' font-weight='700' fill='#1f5fa8' text-anchor='middle'>4</text></g></svg></div></p><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>例題</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>ABCD ～ PQRS，AB ＝ 3，PQ ＝ 6，BC ＝ 2，QR？</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>相似比 3：6 ＝ 1：2。</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>QR ＝ 2 × 2。</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>答：4</p></div><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>例題</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>長 6 寬 4 和長 9 寬 6 的長方形相似嗎？</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>6：4 ＝ 3：2，9：6 ＝ 3：2。</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>答：相似</p></div><h2>常見錯誤</h2><div class='sn-tw'><table class='sn-table'><thead><tr><th>常見錯誤</th><th>正確的想法</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>長、寬都加 2 也相似</td><td>要都乘以同一個數，比才不變</td></tr><tr><td>放大 2 倍，角也變 2 倍</td><td>角度不變</td></tr><tr><td>所有長方形都相似</td><td>長寬比不同就不相似</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
